# Piano: 1

> Demo of velocity and pitch modifiers.
> The v line controls velocity, and the p line controls pitch shift.

C3 | ^ ^ ^ ^ |
v  | !80     |
p  | +2      |

# Drums: 10

> !127 latches the value; 60 is one-shot (then returns to default).

kick  | ^ . ^ . |
v     | !127  60 |
snare | . ^ . ^ |
